  "claims": [
    {
      "text": "Granny Skeleton names him a rank eight Gu Immortal who controls Profound Literature grotto-heaven and has reputation in Eastern Sea’s white heaven. He prefers neutrality and has little interest in alliances that mean fighting and killing, though he still receives An Chong for resource exchange.",
      "chapters": [
        1975
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "intro",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "char_granny_skeleton",
        "sys_gu_immortal",
        "loc_profound_literature_grotto_heaven",
        "reg_eastern_sea",
        "char_an_chong"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Qi Sea Ancestor addresses him as Brother Hua Yu after the defense of Profound Literature grotto-heaven.",
      "chapters": [
        2009
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "intro",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "char_qi_sea_ancestor"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "As grotto-heaven owner he is surprised when Wu Shuai teleports attackers into Profound Literature grotto-heaven, an information path grotto-heaven that should have detected invasion in advance. He fights Dragon Palace with word-based immortal killer moves Cold Words, Quick Words, and Vicious Words, holding ground without losing it for a time. After Qi Sea Ancestor drives Wu Shuai off, Hua Yu places Profound Literature grotto-heaven under Qi Sea Ancestor’s command. Qi Sea Ancestor says they are both humans banding together against variant humans.",
      "chapters": [
        2009
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "wu-shuai-raid",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "char_wu_shuai",
        "house_dragon_palace",
        "move_cold_words",
        "move_quick_words",
        "move_vicious_words"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Jun Shen Guang addresses him as Heaven and Earth Great Love Alliance’s Old Immortal Hua Yu while he is still a member.",
      "chapters": [
        2265
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "fence-and-defection",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "char_jun_shen_guang",
        "fac_heaven_and_earth_great_love_alliance"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Qin Ding Ling judges he hesitates on the fence because he fears Fang Yuan will kill him if he betrays.",
      "chapters": [
        2270
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "fence-and-defection",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "char_qin_ding_ling",
        "char_fang_yuan"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "When Heavenly Court tries to recruit him, he shows the specialty of an information path expert by hinting that Qin Ding Ling and Jun Shen Guang should convince Flickering Light grotto-heaven first.",
      "chapters": [
        2272
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "fence-and-defection",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "fac_heavenly_court",
        "loc_flickering_light_grotto_heaven"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "After Liang Jing Jing helps persuade him, he asks whether Heavenly Court can relocate his grotto-heaven, then convenes his immortals and leads them to switch sides. He offers to help recruit more friends away from the Heaven and Earth Great Love Alliance.",
      "chapters": [
        2273
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "fence-and-defection",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "char_liang_jing_jing"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "With other grotto lords he is gathered under Heavenly Court after relocation, arranged as a formation core for the star array calculation formation above Central Continent. He and Liang Jing Jing greet Qin Ding Ling when other grotto lords snort coldly, then kneel before Star Constellation Immortal Venerable and declare loyalty.",
      "chapters": [
        2275
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "heavenly-court-placement",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "reg_central_continent",
        "char_star_constellation_immortal_venerable"
      ]
    }
  ],
